    {
        "content": "<p>Oh also <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/33501\">#33501</a> has <code>minDegree_of_subsingleton</code> which is the contrapositive of what you asked about</p>",
        "id": 598876181,
